(Japanese: '''セレビィ時を超えた遭遇''' ''Celebi: a Timeless Encounter'') is a graphic novel published by [[Shogakukan]] in Japan. It is a manga-style book (often branded as "Animation Comics" or "Ani-Manga") which retells the plotlines of ''[[M04|Celebi: The Voice of the Forest]]'' and ''[[PK10|Pikachu's PikaBoo]]'' using screenshots from both films. The book credits [[Hideki Sonoda]] and [[Takeshi Shudō]] as the authors.

